    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know... i've tried the things people tell you to do. therapy, everything. but it's like nothing changes. the weight is still there. it's just this constant, relentless exhaustion. it feels like i'm just performing being alive, but there's nothing actually behind it anymore. i'm just so done with the effort of it all.",
