    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no end to it. like it's just this infinite loop of waking up and having to pretend, over and over. everything is just so loud and demanding and i'm just... so empty. i look at people who seem to have energy and i don't even understand how they do it. it makes me think that maybe some people just aren't meant to keep going forever. maybe there's just a limit to what a person can take before it's better to just stop.",
